    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "gmAWJ",
      "x": 1960,
      "y": 22000,
      "name": "V2 / 今天 / 评审记录",
      "width": 560,
      "fill": "$campus-surface",
      "cornerRadius": 24,
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 14,
      "padding": 28,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "DWrsa",
          "name": "Title",
          "fill": "$campus-text",
          "content": "今天页 · 为什么这样排",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 24,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "XCm9H",
          "name": "学生打开「今天」的问",
          "fill": "$campus-text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "学生打开「今天」的问题：我今天必须处理什么？用户明确：截止最重要，其次是邮件里的事。",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "awSbm",
          "name": "旧版（08 / To",
          "fill": "$campus-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "旧版（08 / Today）问题",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "TJQW5",
          "name": "· 课程大卡占 1/",
          "fill": "$campus-text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "· 课程大卡占 1/4 屏，截止被挤到下面；只显示「2 项待办」没有具体是什么\n· 原生版是日历表单：日期写成 2026-10-04、上一段/下一段/刷新全是按钮\n· 没有截止来源：学校同步未接通，只能手动或上传 ICS",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "AJEc6",
          "name": "这版的决定",
          "fill": "$campus-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "这版的决定",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Hcs00",
          "name": "1 日期行直接写一句",
          "fill": "$campus-text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "1 日期行直接写一句话摘要（还有 2 节课、1 项今晚截止），删掉三个统计格——它们和下方内容重复\n2 截止置顶，分「已逾期 / 今天 / 明天·本周」；只有逾期用红色，今天用橙色；每项显示课程色标签和来源（Canvas / 邮件 / 手动），圆圈可直接勾选（动效 M4）\n3 课程卡压缩为两行 + 一个「找课室」；上课前 15 分钟内自动置顶\n4 需要你处理：邮件提取的截止、活动变化、候补确认，右侧直接给动作\n5 下一班车压成一行，点进校园页\n6 第一次使用：只推荐一件事——连接 Canvas；Outlook 标明待学校批准，课表标备用；不显示假数据",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
