        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "l2oVm",
          "x": 44,
          "y": 451,
          "name": "Saved state",
          "fill": "#142D35",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1340,
          "content": "Swipe right / Heart → Saved to your day. Card exits right (350ms), next card springs forward. Timeline gains exact activity. Undo restores previous deck position + removes just that save. Swipe left → next plan. End → All explored + Replay. Existing saves deduplicated.",
          "lineHeight": 1.12,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 20,
          "fontWeight": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "MYPQJ",
          "x": 44,
          "y": 563,
          "name": "Behavior",
          "fill": "#142D35",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1340,
          "content": "Navigation anchors → Experience / Discover / Your day. EN/中文 updates all interface copy and html lang, query param persists on reload. Hero tabs support arrows, Home/End; time slider supports keyboard. Scene changes cross-blur 400ms. Pointer tilts foreground max 7deg; no touch tilt; vertical scrolling preserved. Reduced motion: static orb, instant stage switches, no scroll transforms. Saved status aria-live. Session local storage only, recover gracefully if unavailable.",
          "lineHeight": 1.12,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 20,
          "fontWeight": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "vMg6H",
          "x": 44,
          "y": 750,
          "name": "Copy",
          "fill": "#142D35",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1330,
          "content": "Life happens here. / 校园生活，流动起来。\nLess switching. More living. / 少一点切换，多一点生活。\nFind your kind of people. / 从一起做点什么开始。\nSwipe through plans. Keep what feels like you. / 滑一滑，找到想参加的事。\nChase the last light. / 一起，追场日落。 · Seafront / 海边步道\nA quiet hour, together. / 安静自习，也算一起。 · Library / 图书馆\nOne more game? / 再来一场？ · Sports court / 运动场\nYour day / 我的一天 · Saved to your day / 已加入演示日程 · Skip / 换一个 · Save / 加入日程 · Undo / 撤销\nAll explored / 已看完全部 · Explore again / 再看一遍 · Reset preview / 重置体验\nInteractive preview · sample activities / 交互预览 · 示例活动，不产生真实报名\nYour classes. Your places. Your people. / 课表、去处、相遇，在同一个地方。",
          "lineHeight": 1.12,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 18,
          "fontWeight": "500"
        },
