          "fill": "#142D35",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1330,
          "content": "Below 700px: hero 800px, orbit 380px, single foreground card, auxiliary orbit cards hidden; nav chapter links hidden but all chapters remain scrollable and CTAs available. Min 320px. Landscape uses normal flow. Footer Privacy/Help are existing local pages. Aria labels localised. Buttons min44px.",
